              <h2>Smart Treadmill — NSCC Work-Term Project</h2>
              <p>Smart Treadmill is a full-stack SaaS application I worked on during my work term at Nova Scotia Community College. The project reflects the kind of production work described in my resume: reusable UI components, API-driven features, and collaborative development with Git, pull requests, and code reviews.</p>
              <p>As a full-stack developer, I contributed to the application architecture, component development, API integration, and deployment. The project also used TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, SQLite, and automated quality checks with Vitest, ESLint, Prettier, and GitHub Actions.</p>

